{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Interactions.BorromeanUnique","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Interactions.BorromeanUnique","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.HeckeH3"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromean3_uniqueness_among_short_braids","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromean3_uniqueness_among_short_braids","kind":"theorem","line":222,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L222-L238","doc":"B₃ is the unique braid word of length ≤ 6 such that the\nconfined NF nets match the physical proton and neutron values.\n\nProof: exhaustive enumeration of 4^k words for k ≤ 6,\neach reduced via Hecke relation in ℤ[t,t⁻¹].  Uniqueness\nholds for all q > 1 (all t with |t| > 1), not just at q₀. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromean3_not_identity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromean3_not_identity","kind":"theorem","line":195,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L195-L218","doc":"B₃ is NOT the identity in the standard representation.\nProof: B₃(0,1) ≠ 0 but I(0,1) = 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromean3_entry_01","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromean3_entry_01","kind":"theorem","line":175,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L175-L193","doc":"B₃(0,1) is a nonzero Laurent polynomial.\n\nThis entry is nonzero because B₃ is NOT a scalar matrix.\nThe simp+ring reduction produces the exact Laurent polynomial. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromean3_entry_00","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromean3_entry_00","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L155-L173","doc":"B₃(0,0) expressed in ℤ[t,t⁻¹].\n\nThis is a Laurent polynomial in t that evaluates to ≈ 0.998\nat q₀. The exact symbolic form is derived from the matrix\nproduct of three copies of the Borromean unit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromean3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromean3","kind":"def","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L151-L153","doc":"B₃ = (σ₀σ₁⁻¹)³ in the standard representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromeanUnit_trace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromeanUnit_trace","kind":"theorem","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L136-L147","doc":"tr(σ₀σ₁⁻¹) = 1 − q² − q⁻² in ℤ[t,t⁻¹].\n\nFollows from entries (0,0) = 1-q² and (1,1) = -q⁻². ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromeanUnit_entry_11","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromeanUnit_entry_11","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L125-L134","doc":"(σ₀σ₁⁻¹)(1,1) = −q⁻² in ℤ[t,t⁻¹]. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromeanUnit_entry_10","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromeanUnit_entry_10","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L114-L123","doc":"(σ₀σ₁⁻¹)(1,0) = −q⁻¹ in ℤ[t,t⁻¹]. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromeanUnit_entry_01","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromeanUnit_entry_01","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L103-L112","doc":"(σ₀σ₁⁻¹)(0,1) = q⁻¹ in ℤ[t,t⁻¹]. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromeanUnit_entry_00","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromeanUnit_entry_00","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L89-L101","doc":"(σ₀σ₁⁻¹)(0,0) = 1 − q² in ℤ[t,t⁻¹].\n\nσ₀·σ₁⁻¹ at (0,0) = q·(-q) + 1·1 = 1 − q². ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.borromeanUnit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.borromeanUnit","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L85-L87","doc":"The Borromean unit σ₀·σ₁⁻¹ in the standard representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.hopf_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.hopf_ne","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L66-L81","doc":"L₊ ≠ L₋ in the standard representation.\n\nProof: they differ at entry (0,0): L₊(0,0) = 0 ≠ -1 = L₋(0,0). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.hopfMinus_entry_00","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.hopfMinus_entry_00","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L53-L64","doc":"L₋(0,0) = -1 in ℤ[t,t⁻¹].\n\nσ₁σ₀ at (0,0) = (-q⁻¹)·q + 0·0 = -1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.hopfPlus_entry_00","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.hopfPlus_entry_00","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L40-L51","doc":"L₊(0,0) = 0 in ℤ[t,t⁻¹].\n\nσ₀σ₁ at (0,0) = q·(-q⁻¹) + 1·1 = -1 + 1 = 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.hopfMinus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.hopfMinus","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L36-L38","doc":"L₋ = σ₁σ₀ in the standard representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.hopfPlus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.hopfPlus","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BorromeanUnique.lean#L32-L34","doc":"L₊ = σ₀σ₁ in the standard representation. ","signatureChunk":0}]}